# 11-Uninstall.aws: Packages to uninstall — Amazon Web Services CLI and related tools
#
# Entries listed here are removed by `make uninstall` /
# `make 11_Uninstall_aws` and are filtered out of the matching
# `Install/11-Install.aws` (and same-tier or lower-tier Install files) by the smart
# filter on `make install` — see docs/INSTALL.md.
#
# Format mirrors a Brewfile: `brew '...'`, `cask '...'`, or
# `mas '...', id: NNNNN`. `tap` directives are ignored. Comments and blank
# lines are ignored.

